+        "",
+        f"Interpreter: `{results['runtime']['invoked_interpreter']}` (resolved `{results['runtime']['resolved_interpreter']}`); nice `{results['runtime']['nice']}`; Python-process concurrency `{results['runtime']['python_process_concurrency']}`; all recorded BLAS variables were `1`. No learner, training, optimizer, policy, test split, search grid, manifest setting, sealed constant, threshold, sign, seed, horizon, price, guard, acceptance rule, or control law was changed. The reference checkout and its virtual environment were read-only.",
